  "_comment_meters": "rate_formula is per HOUR and evaluated by the safe AST evaluator. Meters may reference each other by id — the treasury bleeds faster while unrest is high, and unrest climbs while the treasury is empty, so the two feed each other into a spiral if nothing intervenes.",
